FilterForm目前不支持children嵌套children。</p>
<h3 id="filterform-props" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#filterform-props"><span>FilterForm Props</span></a></h3>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>属性</th>
<th>说明</th>
<th>类型</th>
<th>默认值</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>model <strong>(v-model)</strong></td>
<td>表单的值，默认会同步更改。</td>
<td>any</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>components</td>
<td>所有可以配置的组件</td>
<td>IComponent[]</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>collapsed</td>
<td>默认是否收起表单项</td>
<td>boolean</td>
<td>true</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>cols</td>
<td>响应式布局</td>
<td>object</td>
<td>{ xs: 1, sm: 2, md: 3, lg: 3, xl: 4, xxl: 5 }</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>gridProps</td>
<td>Grid组件的属性，优先级最高。</td>
<td>object</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>store</td>
<td><code v-pre>select</code>、<code v-pre>cascader</code>的options选项</td>
<td>object</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>defaultConfig</td>
<td>所有字段的全局配置</td>
<td>config</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>fieldConfig</td>
<td>字段配置，单个字段的配置会覆盖全局配置</td>
<td>&lt;[prop: string]: config&gt;</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>showRememberSelections</td>
<td>是否显示<code v-pre>记住我的选择</code>这个选项</td>
<td>boolean</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>rememberUserKey</td>
<td>全局缓存的key，需要确保全局唯一，如果showRememberSelections 为 true，则必传。</td>
<td>string</td>
<td>-</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>autoRemember</td>
<td>如果数据变化会自动触发缓存记忆，否则需要手动调用方法进行控制。</td>
<td>boolean</td>
<td>true</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
